# Public defaults for the staylytics-dev Supabase project, so preview builds work without extra setup.
# These are browser-safe values (URL and PUBLISHABLE key); row-level security protects the data.
# Environment variables set in Vercel override these. Before launch, set the production
# project's values in Vercel → Production so the live app never points at the dev database.
# Never put secrets here (GEMINI_API_KEY, any sb_secret_ or service-role key).
